<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Balochistan: The Unseen Beauty | Valley of Love</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,500;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #0e1719;        /* page background */
      --panel: #162326;      /* card background */
      --line: #2a3b3f;       /* borders */
      --sand: #e9d8b4;       /* headings */
      --text: #c9d1cc;       /* body text */
      --muted: #8a9a95;
      --sea: #3fb0a6;        /* accent */
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
      color: var(--sand);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

    a:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--sea); outline-offset: 3px; }

    /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
    .hero {
      min-height: 80vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
      background:
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(14,23,25,.55), var(--ink)),
        linear-gradient(120deg, #7a5a2e 0%, #b58a4a 35%, #2b7f86 70%, #0f3d4a 100%);
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 11vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
      color: #fff6df;
    }
    .hero .tagline {
      font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
      color: var(--sand);
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .hero .sub {
      margin-top: .5rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* ---------- Layout ---------- */
    main { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem; }

    .intro { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; }
    .intro h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .intro p { max-width: 65ch; }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    /* ---------- Place cards ---------- */
    .place {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .place:nth-of-type(even) .place-img { order: -1; }

    .place-body { padding: 2rem; }
    .place-body h3 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
    .place-body p { max-width: 55ch; }
    .best-time { margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--sea); font-weight: 500; }

    .place-img {
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 260px;
      background: #1f3236;
    }
    .place-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

    /* ---------- Table ---------- */
    .info h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem); margin: 4rem 0 1.5rem; }
    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 640px; }
    th, td { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    th { background: var(--panel); color: var(--sand); font-weight: 700; }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    tbody tr:hover td { background: rgba(63,176,166,.07); }

    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

    /* ---------- Mobile ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .place { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .place:nth-of-type(even) .place-img { order: 0; }
      .place-img { min-height: 220px; order: -1; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Balochistan</h1>
      <p class="tagline">The unseen beauty</p>
      <p class="sub">Where mountains meet the sea.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="intro">
      <h2>Why Balochistan</h2>
      <p>
        Pakistan's largest province, and its least explored. Golden desert, blue beaches,
        snowy forests, volcanoes, and 7,000 years of history in one place.
        Raw, peaceful, and untouched. No crowds, no noise. Just nature.
      </p>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section-title">Places you must visit</h2>

    <article class="place">
      <div class="place-body">
        <h3>Kund Malir Beach</h3>
        <p>Golden desert mountains touching blue sea. This is not the Maldives. It's better, and it's ours. Camp at night and the stars look like diamonds.</p>
        <p class="best-time">Best time: October to March</p>
      </div>
      <div class="place-img"><img src="hhhh.jpg" alt="Kund Malir Beach on the Gwadar coastal highway" loading="lazy"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="place">
      <div class="place-body">
        <h3>Hingol National Park</h3>
        <p>Feels like Mars on Earth. See the Princess of Hope (a natural rock statue), active mud volcanoes, and wild ibex. Also home to the Hinglaj Mata Temple. A jeep safari is a must.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="place-img"><img src="Moola_Chotuk,_Khuzdar,_Balochistan.jpg" alt="Hingol National Park landscape" loading="lazy"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="place">
      <div class="place-body">
        <h3>Ziarat, City of Juniper</h3>
        <p>5,000-year-old juniper forests, some of the oldest trees in the world. Visit the Quaid-e-Azam Residency, see snowfall in winter, and enjoy the quiet. Best for a family trip from Quetta.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="place-img"><img src="images.jpg" alt="Juniper forest in Ziarat" loading="lazy"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="place">
      <div class="place-body">
        <h3>Gwadar and Astola Island</h3>
        <p>Crystal-clear water where you can see the fish. Take a boat from Gwadar and dolphins follow you. Pakistan's first marine protected island. Try snorkeling, fishing, and boat camping.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="place-img"><img src="hh1.jpg" alt="Astola Island in the Arabian Sea" loading="lazy"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="place">
      <div class="place-body">
        <h3>Moola Chotok, Khuzdar</h3>
        <p>A waterfall in the middle of desert mountains. Reaching it takes an 8-hour road adventure. The road is very difficult, but when you arrive you won't believe your eyes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="place-img"><img src="hwhw.jpg" alt="Moola Chotok waterfall in Khuzdar" loading="lazy"></div>
    </article>

    <article class="place">
      <div class="place-body">
        <h3>Quetta and Hanna Lake</h3>
        <p>Your base for all trips. Hanna Lake, Urak Valley, and the Zarghoon mountains. Known as the Fruit Garden of Pakistan. Don't miss sajji, rosh, and kaak.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="place-img"><img src="a91e26da29e6c6d57c4884624526253e.jpg" alt="Hanna Lake near Quetta" loading="lazy"></div>
    </article>

    <section class="info">
      <h2>Before you visit: things to know</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>No.</th>
              <th>Thing to do</th>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Price (USD)</th>
              <th>Nearest landmark or station</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>1</td><td>Quaid-e-Azam Residency</td><td>Historic</td><td>$5 to $15</td><td>Ziarat Bus Stand</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2</td><td>Hingol National Park</td><td>National park</td><td>Free entry</td><td>N/A</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>Valley of Love</footer>

</body>
</html>
